Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.96,0:01:06.34,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}終わりが来たら　なんて言おう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.55,0:01:11.80,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}どうせならほら　悲しくないように
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.01,0:01:17.27,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}いつかのあなたの言葉が
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.52,0:01:20.23,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}ひどく刺さってる　
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.23,0:01:22.48,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}温かく　
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.48,0:01:25.98,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}残ってる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.20,0:01:36.74,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}知れば知れるだけでいいのに
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.74,0:01:39.16,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}何かを求めてしまう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.58,0:01:42.50,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}大丈夫どこにも行かないよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.50,0:01:44.58,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}どこにも行けないよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.88,0:01:49.30,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}忘れないのに
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.21,0:01:54.93,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}なぜか遠くなる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.55,0:02:01.14,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}瞳の裏にいつも君は居る
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.14,0:02:05.98,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}今もずっとそう
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.65,0:02:07.98,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}いつかね
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.98,0:02:09.23,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}もう少しね
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.23,0:02:13.45,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}世界に優しい風が吹いたら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.45,0:02:17.49,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}何か変わるのでしょうか
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.49,0:02:20.12,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}「帰りたい場所がある」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.12,0:02:23.00,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}誰もがこの星の子孫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.00,0:02:24.50,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}約束はね　
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.50,0:02:25.88,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}大事にね
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.88,0:02:28.04,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}温かく
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.38,0:02:30.30,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\}残ってる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.96,0:01:06.34,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}當結局到來 說些什麼好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.55,0:01:11.80,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}終究有這麼一天 要不就別那麼悲傷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.01,0:01:17.27,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}曾幾何時你給我的話語
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.52,0:01:20.23,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}依然深深刺痛著我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.23,0:01:22.48,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}留在心底
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.48,0:01:25.98,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}溫暖著我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.20,0:01:36.74,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}知道了 也就知道了就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.74,0:01:39.16,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}卻還是不自覺地追尋
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.58,0:01:42.50,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}沒關係 我哪裡都不會去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.50,0:01:44.58,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}也哪裡都去不了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.88,0:01:49.30,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}明明不會忘記
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.21,0:01:54.93,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}卻漸漸模糊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.55,0:02:01.14,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}瞳孔裡總之映照著你的身影
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.14,0:02:05.98,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}現在也一直是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.65,0:02:07.98,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}總有一天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.98,0:02:09.23,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}再多一些
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.23,0:02:13.45,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}當溫柔的風吹過全世界
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.45,0:02:17.49,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}會不會帶來新的變化呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.49,0:02:20.12,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}「我有想回去的地方」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.12,0:02:23.00,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}每個人都是這顆星球的子孫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.00,0:02:24.50,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}約定的事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.50,0:02:25.88,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}放在心裡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.88,0:02:28.04,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}留在心底
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.38,0:02:30.30,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(300,300)\blur2}溫暖著我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.39,0:22:22.19,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}So don't you worry
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.07,0:22:26.75,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}あなたに知られないように
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.56,0:22:31.61,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}あなたを守れますように
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.81,0:22:37.51,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}The story has only just begun
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.48,0:22:40.35,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}あてのない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.18,0:22:44.81,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}道なき道にいてもどうか
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.70,0:22:49.76,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}迷いながらいてもどうか
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.00,0:22:52.19,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}希望が
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.19,0:22:54.76,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}そこにあるよう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.76,0:22:57.58,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}ともにあるよう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.58,0:22:59.57,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}We are…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.57,0:23:02.21,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}どこにでも行ける羽を
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.21,0:23:03.84,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}We are…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.84,0:23:06.26,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}あなたに授けたの
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.26,0:23:13.37,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}どんな闇も晴らしてしまえるように
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.61,0:23:17.38,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}You gave me Holy brave
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.57,0:23:22.11,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}恐れずに進め Oh Holy brave
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.11,0:23:26.47,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}振り返ればいつも Holy trace
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.47,0:23:30.64,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}あなたが笑ってた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.64,0:23:35.40,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}だからHoly brave
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.65,0:23:40.13,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}躓きながらでもHoly brave
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.13,0:23:44.54,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}私は踏みだせる 遠くへ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.54,0:23:49.22,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}あなたがいる場所へ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.39,0:22:22.19,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}所以你不用擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.07,0:22:26.75,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}小心翼翼不讓你知曉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.56,0:22:31.61,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}希望能永遠保佑你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.81,0:22:37.51,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}故事才剛剛開始
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.48,0:22:40.35,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}就算在一條
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.18,0:22:44.81,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}沒有終點的野徑上
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.70,0:22:49.76,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}即使已經迷茫於旅途
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.00,0:22:52.19,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}希望
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.19,0:22:54.76,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}請留在那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.76,0:22:57.58,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}請與我同在
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.58,0:22:59.57,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}我們…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.57,0:23:02.22,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}送給你一對翅膀
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.22,0:23:03.84,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}我們…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.84,0:23:06.26,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}它能帶你去往任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.26,0:23:13.37,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}希望能幫你照亮一切黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.61,0:23:17.38,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}你賜予我神聖的勇氣
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.57,0:23:22.11,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}不要害怕向前進 神聖的勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.11,0:23:26.47,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}每次回首都能看到  神聖的軌跡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.47,0:23:30.64,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}你的笑容就在那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.64,0:23:35.40,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}所以啊 神聖的勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.65,0:23:40.13,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}即使跌跌撞撞 神聖的勇氣
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.13,0:23:44.54,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}我也可以邁出步伐 去往遠方
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.54,0:23:49.22,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}去往有你的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.14,0:02:35.01,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn@方正悠宋 GBK 509R\an1\fr-90\fs45\pos(1425,125)\be0.5}勇者辛美爾\N死後   年
